    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Our model (8) is achieved at second order of the perturbation series. Higher order terms become truncation errors but may be controlled by small parameters λx,y,z/Jcluster ∼ |Jx,y,z|/Jcluster."
  }, {
